[{"client_msg_id":"56e39218-2838-4ba2-9375-f6e466bc6854","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/news/210823q\u003e\nへー、そしてかわいい","ts":"1629791983.279700","attachments":[{"fallback":"電ファミニコゲーマー – ゲームの面白い記事読んでみない？: 小さなクモになって冒険する2Dアクション『Webbed』Steamで9月9日16時に配信開始へ。クモ恐怖症の人へ配慮した表示切替モードも搭載 | 電ファミニコゲーマー – ゲームの面白い記事読んでみない？","id":1,"title":"小さなクモになって冒険する2Dアクション『Webbed』Steamで9月9日16時に配信開始へ。クモ恐怖症の人へ配慮した表示切替モードも搭載 | 電ファミニコゲーマー – ゲームの面白い記事読んでみない？","title_link":"https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/news/210823q","text":"　オーストラリア・クイーンズランド州に拠点を置くSbug Gamesは、小さなクモを操作するPC（Steam）用2Dアクションゲーム『Webbed』を日本時間9月9日（木）16時に配信すると発表した。","image_url":"https://img-denfaminicogamer.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/WEBBED-thumb.jpg","fields":[{"title":"Written by","value":"yoshimune","short":true},{"title":"Est. reading time","value":"1分","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1629732792,"service_name":"電ファミニコゲーマー – ゲームの面白い記事読んでみない？","service_icon":"https://img-denfaminicogamer.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/news/210823q","original_url":"https://news.denfaminicogamer.jp/news/210823q"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"au2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b9b090c-7698-4513-ad3d-3f9f57c03bd6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"VR SUPのやつが、パドル保持をトリガで利き手変更にしていて、普段はトラッカーに付属状態だったので、そっちほうこうじゃないかな(じゃないとトリガしっぱなしがつらい)","ts":"1629778792.279400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tWi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"268cf4f5-3b61-4c24-8505-8ad0231bb22e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これ操作がどうなるかってまだ分からないですよね\n実際にトラッキングで操作するなら本当に拷問として使えそう","ts":"1629776819.278400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OE7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33B49BC9-F392-4CB2-AA82-15C6E21C984A","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"リアルにハンマー持ってVRプレイする人が現れる未来が見える","ts":"1629776212.277700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cakm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b25f2518-31a5-47ce-aac8-50fa68f6cb3c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20210816-172438/\u003e","ts":"1629776029.276700","attachments":[{"fallback":"AUTOMATON: “壺おじ”こと『Getting Over It』をVR化するユーザー現る。落下時の絶望感も増し、セルフ拷問度高し | AUTOMATON","id":1,"title":"“壺おじ”こと『Getting Over It』をVR化するユーザー現る。落下時の絶望感も増し、セルフ拷問度高し | AUTOMATON","title_link":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20210816-172438/","text":"“壺おじ”や“壺男”といった愛称で知られる『Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy』をVR化するユーザーが現れたようだ。セルフ拷問度が高そうである。","image_url":"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/20210816-172438-header.jpg","fields":[{"title":"によって書かれた","value":"Ayuo Kawase","short":true},{"title":"推定読書時間","value":"1分","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1629089657,"service_name":"AUTOMATON","service_icon":"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/automaton-sitelogo-003.png","from_url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20210816-172438/","original_url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20210816-172438/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"baw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32ab8f94-6704-454f-9ab7-aeb17a02b642","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そういえばVR壺おじの噂を最近聞いたような","ts":"1629775727.276400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XYc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"903b5b98-02e1-4b66-93b6-89525667c417","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"加減がわかんなかったのはあるんだろうけど...\n最近やったVRのSPUのパドリングとDisc Golfのスローといい、腕にくるw","ts":"1629775705.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tAMQF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ece849f-7e27-4885-9e01-62e342841577","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"VRで空手とか太極拳とか教えている道場ってあるのかなとふと思ったり\n(力の緩急は武道・武術で覚えるのが身につきやすい、たぶん)","ts":"1629775658.275100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nwp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd168c37-50a0-43b5-a088-f5cfbc5cd2fe","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あのVRゴリラ腕のトラッキングで速度を見ててすばやく壁を殴ると反動で飛べるシステムなんです\nで、チュートリアルの最後は、幅のあるチムニー(煙突)を左右をなぐって上にいくという","ts":"1629775637.274700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WnpN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ef365cc-043c-4db7-b8e2-1dd2c88818ac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"腕を必要以上に力いっぱいに振り回す必要がある\nしかもチャットめんどくてチュートリアル部分だけやって他の人がいるの見た時点で止めてこれ","ts":"1629775541.272700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D/jiD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15d2a124-a934-481c-860c-908b13d8c9e0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"VRChatをやると無意識に内股気味になるというのを聞いたけど、VRゴリラをやるとどうなるのだろうか","ts":"1629775247.271900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WyDf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"435fee98-c6ba-43e3-8ce9-cac0e02a2472","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"昨日ちょっと体調よくなくて休んだんだが、それでも今日もゴリラで腕が筋肉痛...w","ts":"1629775190.271200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ki1g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e81f45c1-a195-434a-b1d8-c99e77e5c024","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"月姫の発売日が近くなったのでアニプレックスプラスにログインしようとしたらリニューアルしたとかでパスワードを再登録する必要があった\n同時にクレカ情報も消えてたので登録し直した（アカウントとの紐付けが切れただけで注文とはまだ紐付いてたっぽい？）","ts":"1629773784.270500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N=T"}]}]
